OL,6,     FNash Metropolitan/1935 AC
OL,7,     FAce/Ariel Atom Vauxhall Vectra:
OL,8,     FDerek's in Cambridgeshire picking
OL,9,     Fup a car built in Britain in the
OL,10,     F'50s for the US market.
OL,11,G2200 Bangers & Cash
OL,12,     FCortina/Granada: Dave travels to
OL,13,     Fleafy Leicestershire where Steve
OL,14,     FPerry has a 1980 Ford Granada Ghia
OL,15,     Fand a 1981 Ford Cortina.
OL,16,G2300 Bangers & Cash
OL,17,     FLotus Esprit/Land Rover: Derek
OL,18,     Fheads to County Durham, where Neil
OL,19,     FWalker is selling his late dad's
OL,20,     Fcar collection, including a
OL,21,     FJapanese take on a classic British
OL,22,     FJag: the Mitsuoka Viewt.
